WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,240
Can't be wrong

2
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:02,330
This is a family thing

3
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,770
Only the Gu family is important

4
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,290
That’s why I engraved this unique seal

5
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,610
Who is this young man?

6
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:08,890
This damn fire plan

7
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,730
You just gave it to me without looking clearly

8
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:14,940
What does the little brother call the shopkeeper?

9
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,340
I'm here to be a pawn

10
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,050
You should also write down the names of things

11
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:21,050
Otherwise, how will we be familiar with each other in the future?

12
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:25,620
Silver Bounty Player

13
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,900
How many eleven liang do you plan to pay?

14
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:40,180
I can give you fifteen taels of gold, a good deal. What do you want to eat?

15
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,460
Is braised lion head okay?

16
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,340
Don't eat, don't eat, don't eat anything

17
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,340
You actually pawned the knife, but that's the only thing with you

18
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:50,890
It doesn't matter if life is relevant. I don't care.

19
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,700
You don’t want to see your parents

20
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:58,260
That was before now

21
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,680
The most important thing is to eat delicious food with Niannian

22
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:04,110
I'm not a talkative guy

23
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:06,630
But you are growing taller, it’s you
